    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-status\"><header><strong>WquGuru</strong></header><div class=\"tw-body\">Microduck 是新时代的树莓派吗？<br><br>树莓派当年解决的是普通人第一次能摸到完整计算机，而 Microduck 想解决的是普通人第一次能摸到完整的具身智能闭环：传感器、舵机、仿真、强化学习、真机部署。它把 Physical AI 的入门门槛，从实验室搬到了书桌。我花了一周时间学习了一遍，整理了一批高质量推文：<br><br>1. 先看它是什么<br>官宣：<br>真机能做什么：<a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/pollenrobotics/status/2092990523522838959\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/pollenrobotics<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">/status/2092990523522838959</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\">…</span></a><br>Sim2Real 才是核心，不只是外壳可爱： <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/pollenrobotics/status/2093035817241661639\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/pollenrobotics<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">/status/2093035817241661639</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\">…</span></a><br><br>2. 它从哪来<br><br>前世今生： <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/MinLiBuilds/status/2095713417340616706\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/MinLiBuilds/st<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">atus/2095713417340616706</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\">…</span></a><br>Open Duck Mini 60 秒从零件到走路： <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/MeRTcooking/status/2093623072880545935\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/MeRTcooking/st<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">atus/2093623072880545935</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\">…</span></a><br>零件与套件清单： <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/Em_Nomadic/status/2094103307635585413\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/Em_Nomadic/sta<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">tus/2094103307635585413</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\">…</span></a><br><br>3. 对比树莓派<br><br>树莓派值钱的不是那块板，是：便宜、开源、文档全、社区自己出来教程和周边。Microduck 正在重现类似盛况：<br><br>从零 DIY 复刻长文： <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/tspy/status/2094963381220622638\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/tspy/status/20<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">94963381220622638</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\">…</span></a><br>复刻系列合集（架构、爆炸图、成本、CAD、仿真、真机）： <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/tspy/status/2096864229689294867\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/tspy/status/20<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">96864229689294867</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\">…</span></a><br>全网首只 DIY 真机（FanGe）： <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/tspy/status/2097282050055438414\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/tspy/status/20<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">97282050055438414</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\">…</span></a><br>70个零件的 3D 拆解应用： <a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"/tspy/status/2096238855519453662\" role=\"link\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\">https://</span>x.com/tspy/status/20<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-